# Canonical host + HTTPS.
#
# LEAVE THIS BLOCK COMMENTED until the Let's Encrypt certificate exists in the
# DreamHost panel for BOTH jamespwright.com and www.jamespwright.com. Enabling
# it first redirects visitors to a URL with no certificate — a broken site.
#
# RewriteEngine On
# RewriteCond %{HTTPS} !=on [OR]
# RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^www\. [NC]
# RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://jamespwright.com/$1 [R=301,L]

# No auto-generated directory listings. Unlinked routes dropped into the web
# root are reachable by URL but do not advertise their contents. A directory
# that should be browsable opts back in with its own .htaccess containing
# "Options +Indexes" — ebooks/ does this.
Options -Indexes

DirectoryIndex index.html

ErrorDocument 404 /404.html
